HEAD:.task-board/.resources/TASK-260903-2e8rws/TASK-260903-2e8rws_notes.md:4:Confirmation is computed from configuration, not dropped. `version_control.confirm` still governs hand-typed Bug/Story `done` transitions (`commit_ack=scope_committed`); the new `version_control.commit_time_policy` key lets `worktree integrate` and `worktree checkpoint` resolve the commit time unattended in the order: `--commit-time` flag, policy, now-when-confirm-false, otherwise refuse `commit_time_policy_unconfigured` with the config key in the packet.
HEAD:.task-board/.resources/TASK-260903-2e8rws/TASK-260903-2e8rws_notes.md:9:- `tools/board-cli/internal/changerequest/`: `CheckpointRequest` carries flag/policy/confirm/Now, resolves before any Git read/move, stamps both dates via `GIT_AUTHOR_DATE/COMMITTER_DATE`; new typed `commit_time_policy_unconfigured`.
HEAD:.task-board/.resources/TASK-260903-2e8rws/TASK-260903-2e8rws_notes.md:10:- `tools/board-cli/cmd/`: `worktree_integrate.go` passes the sidecar policy; `worktree_checkpoint.go` gains `--commit-time` and passes flag/policy/confirm; `auth.go` projects `version_control.commit_time_policy` (null when absent).
HEAD:.task-board/.resources/TASK-260903-2e8rws/TASK-260903-2e8rws_notes.md:16:- `pkg/remoteconfig/commit_time_policy_test.go`: validation table (unknown kind/malformed time/unknown zone/missing fields/duplicate key), fixed-clock 20:01 Europe/Moscow on 2026-08-07, America/New_York DST-boundary offset case, order + never-silently-now refusal.
HEAD:.task-board/.resources/TASK-260903-2e8rws/TASK-260903-2e8rws_notes.md:17:- `tools/board-cli/internal/integration/commit_time_policy_test.go`: policy landing stamps both commits (asserted via `git show %aI/%cI`), flag-wins, confirm=false uses now, resume reuses recorded time, --json carries both fields; `uncovered_gates_test.go` row updated to the new typed refusal + no-txn assertion.
