/Users/iv/.claude/skills/project-management/references/file-formats.md-620-Story/epic links created explicitly remain persisted manual dependencies and continue to affect ordering and blocking through `blockedBy` / `blocks`. Task-level `link`/`unlink` and task/bug `set_parent` never remove those manual edges as an implicit side effect. Unsupported container state is removed only through the explicit `repair-links --confirm` workflow.
